1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,850
Welcome back to the final over
of this thrilling chase.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,700
Twelve runs needed from six balls.

3
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:09,900
Arjun Mehta runs in from the pavilion end.

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,600
Full and straight, yorker length,
dug out for a single.

5
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:15,800
Eleven needed from five.

6
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:19,350
Short ball now, and Rohan Kapoor
pulls it away!

7
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:21,900
That is FOUR through square leg.

8
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,300
Seven required from four balls,
the crowd is on its feet.

9
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:28,400
Slower ball, beats the bat,
straight to the keeper.

10
00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:31,700
Big appeal for caught behind...
not out, says the umpire.

11
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:34,900
They have gone upstairs for the DRS review.

12
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:38,600
No edge on UltraEdge.
The batter survives!

13
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,200
Length ball, lofted over long-on,
that is SIX!

14
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:45,300
What a finish! They win with two balls to spare.
